# provenance: PV-0001, PV-0002, PV-0003
# kind: ni-stream
# description: The stream ends after 3 of the 4 length bytes.
# derivation: A frame needs 4 length bytes (PV-0001); at end of stream 3 buffered bytes mean the stream ended inside a frame (truncated).
